        "content": "## Weekly KPI Report\nEvery Monday 08:00: pulls GA4 for the last 7 days and the 7 before, computes week-over-week change, asks GPT for a 3-bullet executive summary and emails + posts the report.\n\n**Setup:** Google Analytics (GA4 property ID), OpenAI, Gmail and Slack credentials.",
