        "text": "=Here are this week's website KPIs vs last week as JSON:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.kpis) }}\n\nWrite exactly 3 short bullet points for a busy founder: the biggest change, what probably caused it, and one concrete action for this week. Plain text, no fluff."
      },
